[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27211.75, "timestamp": "07:33:31", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27214.548, "timestamp": "07:33:34", "text": "请杀了他。求求你，求求你，求求你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27220.708, "timestamp": "07:33:40", "text": "鱼。我需要我的军衔。你一定可以的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27222.868, "timestamp": "07:33:42", "text": "等等，我们是攻击者吗？不，我们输了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27229.43, "timestamp": "07:33:49", "text": "需要我帮忙吗？我是说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27231.51, "timestamp": "07:33:51", "text": "你觉得你能加入吗？因为你已经加入了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27233.99, "timestamp": "07:33:53", "text": "大师也是，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27236.43, "timestamp": "07:33:56", "text": "当第二个像更高时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27238.75, "timestamp": "07:33:58", "text": "联赛"}]